# Input

```html
<!-- The delimiter is whichever quote needs the fewest escapes, and only that
     one stays escaped. -->
<div a="&apos;"></div>
<div a='&quot;'></div>
<div a='&apos;&quot;'></div>
<div a="&apos;&apos;&quot;"></div>
<div a='&quot;&quot;&apos;'></div>

<!-- A literal quote counts the same as its entity. -->
<div a='" &apos;'></div>
<div a='" " &apos;'></div>

<!-- Entities that are not quotes are left exactly as written. -->
<div a="&amp; &lt; &gt; &#39; &#x27;"></div>

<!-- Nothing to requote. -->
<div a=""></div>
<div a=bare></div>

```


# Formatted

```html
<!-- The delimiter is whichever quote needs the fewest escapes, and only that
     one stays escaped. -->
<div a="'"></div>
<div a='"'></div>
<div a="'&quot;"></div>
<div a="''&quot;"></div>
<div a='""&apos;'></div>

<!-- A literal quote counts the same as its entity. -->
<div a="&quot; '"></div>
<div a='" " &apos;'></div>

<!-- Entities that are not quotes are left exactly as written. -->
<div a="&amp; &lt; &gt; &#39; &#x27;"></div>

<!-- Nothing to requote. -->
<div a=""></div>
<div a="bare"></div>

```
